formulas(assumptions).

% FCRA 1681i(a)(1)(A): If a consumer disputes accuracy, the agency must reinvestigate.
all x all item (Consumer(x) & DispatchesDispute(x, item) -> MustReinvestigate(lexisnexis, item)).

% FCRA 1681i(a)(5)(A): If item is inaccurate or unverifiable, it must be deleted/modified.
all item (FoundInaccurate(item) | Unverifiable(item) -> MustDeleteOrModify(lexisnexis, item)).

% Facts from your audit:
Consumer(travis_ryle).
DispatchesDispute(travis_ryle, middle_initial_error).
FoundInaccurate(middle_initial_error).

end_of_list.

formulas(goals).
    % Goal: Prove LexisNexis is legally mandated to remove the error.
    MustDeleteOrModify(lexisnexis, middle_initial_error).
end_of_list.
